 Zone", "keywords": ["asteroids", "arcade", "classic", "remake", "space"], "long_description": "A warp-gate malfunction has landed you smack-dab in the middle of an asteroid field... and a time-space anomaly has you stuck there!  Equipped with blasters, a tractor-beam and an energy shield, how long can you survive the Impact Zone?\n\n-Wave after wave of asteroids\n-UFO's to face\n-Power-ups to enhance your chances\n-Shield and Tractor-Beam to help you survive\n-Leave the spherical time-space anomaly and come in on the other side", "short_description": "Survive waves of asteroids in classic arcade action reimagined for the 21st century."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://chadshepard.net/ImpactZonePrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Thursday Night Game Developers Club", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61550361903860", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9383449131683560"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75556803_520328500715613_256091926291427717_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=283Q9gB5LJ8Q7kNvwG-ODxU&_nc_oc=AdobxRbzU3M87vmc1NiEEuKbrktleZJM9Z2QzpXF714c74z4Y3AMMKy0XdkzqX740jM&_nc